      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To be fair, it's also a hard limitation and expensive performance wise for Unity, there's a hard engine limitation for worlds aswell, so imagine if multiple people with 5+ audio sources avatars were going around a SFX heavy world.\nI don't have data to back me up rn, but this is pretty widely known sadly.\nI've never animated with an audio source as I only do worlds, but couldn't you instead have all sounds that could happen in a single source and go  to that specific part of the clip for specific animations?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
